{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24845","headline":"咏春色 · 杨衡","name":"咏春色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霭霭复蒙蒙，非雾满晴空。\n密添宫柳翠，暗泄路桃红。\n萦丝光乍失，缘隟影才通。\n夕迷鸳枕上，朝漫绮弦中。\n促驷驰香陌，劳莺转艳丛。\n可怜肠断望，并在洛城东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}